# Mapbox token for place geocoding ONLY (/api/geocode).
# Create at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
#
# Critical: do NOT enable "URL restrictions" on this token.
# Geocoding runs on the server (Vite/Netlify) with no browser Referer —
# URL-restricted tokens return HTTP 403 and place search breaks.
# Enable Geocoding scopes; a public pk. token is fine.
MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=pk.your_mapbox_token_here
